    - M08
  itemRiddles:
  - itemId: H01
    itemName: "Doll"
    lowClue: "A child’s friend with a still face."
    midClue: "It was held every night, but never held back."
    highClue: "Company, long after they left."
  - itemId: H02
    itemName: "Scalpel"
    lowClue: "It once healed by cutting, and now it only rots."
    midClue: "Small and sharp, it opened people to save them."
    highClue: "It hurt to help."
  - itemId: H03
    itemName: "Patient Wristband"
    lowClue: "A name tied around the wrist; the name is gone."
    midClue: "It said who you were while you lay still."
    highClue: "Proof of someone no one remembers."
  - itemId: H04
    itemName: "Stethoscope"
    lowClue: "It once listened for a heartbeat. Now it hears nothing."
    midClue: "It hung around a neck and listened to chests."
    highClue: "It waits for a sound that never comes."
  - itemId: H05
    itemName: "Music Box"
    lowClue: "Wind it up and it hums a song for the forgotten."
    midClue: "Turn it and it remembers a tune."
    highClue: "A small song that plays for no one."
  - itemId: H06
    itemName: "Medical Chart"
    lowClue: "It records who lived and who did not."
    midClue: "Pages that followed every patient’s last days."
    highClue: "Everything about you, written by strangers."
  - itemId: H07
    itemName: "Syringe"
    lowClue: "A needle that never finished its dose."
    midClue: "It was meant to heal, but stopped halfway."
    highClue: "Something left unfinished."
  - itemId: H08
    itemName: "Glove"
    lowClue: "It held a hand, and the hand was not clean."
    midClue: "Worn to keep hands safe from what they touched."
    highClue: "An empty shape of someone."
  - itemId: P01
    itemName: "Key"
    lowClue: "It opens a door no one wants opened."
    midClue: "Small, metal, and the only way out."
    highClue: "What everyone here wants, but no one holds."
  - itemId: P02
    itemName: "Tin Cup"
    lowClue: "It rattled against bars at supper."
    midClue: "Meals came in it, and noise came out."
    highClue: "It made the only music here."
  - itemId: P03
    itemName: "Cell Number Plate"
    lowClue: "A number is all that was left of the man…or woman.."
    midClue: "It named the room, not the person inside."
    highClue: "Here, you were only counted."
  - itemId: P04
    itemName: "Prisoner Diary"
    lowClue: "The last words of someone’s final moments.."
    midClue: "Days were written in it when nothing else could leave."
    highClue: "A voice that never got out."
  - itemId: P05
    itemName: "Shiv"
    lowClue: "Sharpened, hidden from the guards."
    midClue: "Made in secret from something harmless."
    highClue: "A small promise of trouble."
  - itemId: P06
    itemName: "Prison Uniform"
    lowClue: "Cloth that marks a man as property."
    midClue: "Everyone wore the same one, and no one chose it."
    highClue: "It made everyone the same."
  - itemId: P07
    itemName: "Shackles"
    lowClue: "They hold no one now, yet they still clink."
    midClue: "They kept hands and feet close together."
    highClue: "Even empty, they remember the weight."
  - itemId: P08
    itemName: "Poster"
    lowClue: "Stuck on the wall forever but brings colour to the plain wall ."
    midClue: "Paper that dreamed of somewhere else."
    highClue: "A view that isn’t really there."
  - itemId: M01
    itemName: "Mirror"
    lowClue: "It shows you a face you no longer recognise."
    midClue: "It copies everything and keeps nothing."
    highClue: "It only knows you from the front."
  - itemId: M02
    itemName: "Plushie"
    lowClue: "A soft best friend.."
    midClue: "Stuffed, stitched and squeezed in the dark."
    highClue: "Comfort that never spoke."
  - itemId: M03
    itemName: "Pocket Watch"
    lowClue: "Its hands stopped the night the family died."
    midClue: "It was carried close and counted every second."
    highClue: "It kept time until time stopped mattering."
  - itemId: M04
    itemName: "Candlestick"
    lowClue: "It held the flame that lit the hall."
    midClue: "It stood still while the light did the work."
    highClue: "It held something that was never meant to stay."
  - itemId: M05
    itemName: "Family Portrait"
    lowClue: "Painted faces that watch you move."
    midClue: "Everyone posed and smiled for it, once."
    highClue: "The family that is still all together."
  - itemId: M06
    itemName: "Veil"
    lowClue: "Worn on a wedding day that never ended."
    midClue: "Thin enough to see through, meant to hide a face."
    highClue: "A promise left hanging."
  - itemId: M07
    itemName: "Rope"
    lowClue: "It once drew the curtain on the last act."
    midClue: "Twisted fibres that pulled and held."
    highClue: "It held things together, until it didn’t."
  - itemId: M08
    itemName: "Spoon"
    lowClue: "It fed a family that no longer eats."
    midClue: "It went from bowl to mouth at every meal."
    highClue: "The smallest part of every dinner."
